    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4717" root="ثمل" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُمَالَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُمْلَةٌ</span>, in two places: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَمِيلَةٌ</span>.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, (S, M, Mgh, Msb, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُمَالٌ</span></b> , (M,
Mgh,) accord. to Th, (M,) or the latter is pl. of
the former, (S, M, Msb, K,) [or rather coll. gen. n.,]
<i>Froth,</i> (S, M, Mgh, Msb, K,) <i>of any kind:</i> (M:)
or <i>froth of milk</i> (Th, M) <i>when it is drawn.</i> (M.)

